WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.734 --> 00:00:05.769
Today's Monday Minute is "Remember why".

00:00:05.769 --> 00:00:08.146
When times are tough with your business,

00:00:08.146 --> 00:00:10.121
when people aren't believing in you,

00:00:10.121 --> 00:00:13.423
when you're not seeing the results that you want in your business,

00:00:13.423 --> 00:00:15.568
if you're not seeing ANY results.

00:00:15.568 --> 00:00:19.130
Ok? If you're waking up and you feel like you're talking to yourself all the time,

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:22.322
and you're not getting any momentum with your company,

00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:24.320
and you feel like you should quit and give up

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:27.655
and you feel like maybe you should go get a job because nobody's believing in you.

00:00:27.655 --> 00:00:31.260
If that's happening to you, remember why.

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:34.753
Remember why you started your business, remember why it's important,

00:00:34.753 --> 00:00:40.409
remember why this HAS to happen, because every entrepreneur goes through that cycle,

00:00:40.409 --> 00:00:45.076
where they feel like they´re going to give up and they go get a job and quit.

00:00:45.076 --> 00:00:50.409
And the thing that gets you through is remembering why.

00:00:50.409 --> 00:00:53.414
Make sure you have a powerful reason.

00:00:53.414 --> 00:00:55.248
Believe!

00:00:55.248 --> 00:00:57.638
If you guys liked this video, please give it a thumbs up below.

00:00:57.638 --> 00:01:00.294
Leave a comment, leave a question, I'll make a video response.

00:01:00.294 --> 00:01:02.402
Thank you so much and I'll see you soon!

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.000
